// Package core is the VM's hot instructions in PASM, core.spin2, executed on
// the cog of the scheduler that calls it. The board program hands Run to the
// VM as vm.Core; the twin, which cannot run PASM, leaves the package out, and
// the VM then does every instruction itself.

// Run does instructions from the pc in the block at blk until one it leaves
// to the VM, and answers that one's index. core.spin2 says what the block
// holds.
func Run(blk uint32) uint32
